# omamobile-pins — the Omarchy Mobile packages this image takes from the
# project's signed repository (https://pkgs.omamobile.org/stable/aarch64),
# one per line: name<TAB>upstream_filename<TAB>sha256. tools/fetch-omamobile
# downloads exactly these files, checks each against its pin, against the
# signed repository index omamobile.db (the pin must be the digest the index
# carries) and against its detached signature, made by a key of
# omamobile-keyring (itself pinned here: the first line), whose keys must all
# be listed in omamobile-trusted.fpr.
#
# The pins are the owner's other tablet port's (Lenovomarchy,
# image/tools/repack.omamobile.pins and the keyring pin of its
# tools/repack-omamobile), checked again on 2026-11-24. Taken for the SM-T715:
#   omamobile-settings  Omarchy Mobile's Settings app (About, Display)
#   omamobile-remote    drives the session over ssh: screenshots, taps, keys,
#                       apps (enables nothing by itself); the owner's tool for
#                       the bring-up
#   wlrctl              the virtual pointer and keyboard omamobile-remote uses
# Not taken: omacam (no camera driver on arm64 yet), the phone's packages.
#
# name	upstream_filename	sha256
